sues/107799\r\n\r\nIt seems that `AudioListener3D` did not have any code for using its own velocity for doppler calculation, so I essentially just copied over the `Camera3D` doppler code. Didn't need to change much at all, the code for the camera doppler calculation does everything it needs to do and nothing more.\r\n\r\nNow, doppler works as expected when the listener moves.\r\n\r\nThis will have a noticeable but also likely preferable change in sound for projects which use doppler and a moving listener.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/o